-**Parameters:**
-*   **Aperture Parameter $K$:** Learnable per image. Initialized or optimized jointly [S1].
-*   **Focus Distance $F$:** Learnable per image. Initialized or optimized jointly [S1].
-*   **Patch Size:** $N_{patch} \times N_{patch}$ pixels [S1].
